# Example program arguments for apple_audio_example
# Copy this file content to CLion's run configuration "Program arguments" field
# Or set it as default in the run configuration

# Example: Use a sample audio file (update path to your actual audio file)
# /path/to/your/audio/file.mp3

# Or use a file from macOS system sounds (example):
# /System/Library/Sounds/Glass.aiff

# Note: You need to provide a valid audio file path as the first argument

